#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:4
msgid "Wire protocol"
msgstr "线路协议"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:6
msgid ""
"ANetCore is the Go module that holds the parts of ANet which must be "
"identical in every program: how objects are encoded, hashed, signed and "
"sealed, and how an identity is derived and verified. The ``anet`` daemon,"
" the hub and the ANetLink bridge import it and never each other, so a "
"wire type is defined once. This page describes the protocol of ANetCore "
"v0.16 (ANet 0.3). The complete register of key numbers, labels, routes "
"and codes is the file ``docs/wire-keys.md`` of the ANetCore repository, "
"generated from ``wire/registry.json``; the tables on this page are "
"generated from the same file."
msgstr ""
"ANetCore 是一个 Go 模块，包含 ANet "
"中必须在每个程序里保持一致的部分：对象如何编码、哈希、签名和密封，以及身份如何派生和验证。\\ ``anet`` 守护进程、hub 和 "
"ANetLink 桥接程序都导入它，而不互相导入，因此线路类型只定义一次。本页描述 ANetCore v0.16（ANet "
"0.3）的协议。键编号、标签、路由和原因码的完整登记表是 ANetCore 仓库中的文件 ``docs/wire-keys.md``，由 "
"``wire/registry.json`` 生成；本页的表格由同一文件生成。"

