#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:56
msgid "Encoding: CoreDet-CBOR"
msgstr "编码：CoreDet-CBOR"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:58
msgid ""
"Every object that is hashed or signed is encoded as CoreDet-CBOR, the "
"profile of RFC 8949 section 4.2 (Core Deterministic Encoding) with two "
"additional rules."
msgstr "每个参与哈希或签名的对象都编码为 CoreDet-CBOR，即 RFC 8949 第 4.2 节（核心确定性编码）的规范，另加两条规则。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:61
msgid ""
"Integers and lengths have the shortest form, items have a definite length"
" and map keys are sorted by the bytewise order of their encodings. The "
"length-first sort of the older RFC 7049 canonical form is not used."
msgstr "整数和长度采用最短形式，各项具有确定长度，映射键按其编码的字节序排序。不使用较早的 RFC 7049 规范形式中先比长度的排序。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:64
msgid "A value must not be NaN or infinite, and no CBOR tag may occur."
msgstr "值不得为 NaN 或无穷大，也不得出现任何 CBOR 标签。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:66
msgid ""
"A decoder rejects duplicate map keys. The strict decoder, used for every "
"object of the protocol, also rejects a map key that the destination type "
"does not name. Objects are maps with integer keys. Key numbers, labels "
"and codes are never reused: a removed key is *retired* and refused when "
"present, and a key that was never assigned is *reserved* and also "
"refused. Objects that carry the note *keys 0 to 63 must be understood* "
"ignore unknown keys from 64 upward but still cover them in the digest. "
"Times are Unix milliseconds. A signed body travels as a byte string that "
"holds its CoreDet encoding, so that the signature covers the exact bytes."
msgstr ""
"解码器拒绝重复的映射键。协议中所有对象所用的严格解码器，还会拒绝目标类型未命名的映射键。对象是以整数为键的映射。键编号、标签和原因码从不重用：已移除的键被"
" *淘汰*，出现时被拒绝；从未分配的键被 *保留*，同样被拒绝。带有说明 *keys 0 to 63 must be understood* "
"的对象，忽略从 64 起的未知键，但仍将其计入摘要。时间为 Unix 毫秒。签名正文以字节串形式传递，字节串中是它的 CoreDet "
"编码，因此签名覆盖的是确切的字节。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:75
msgid ""
"A content identifier (CID) is CIDv1 with the codec dag-cbor and the hash "
"sha2-256. The binary prefix is ``0x01 0x71 0x12 0x20`` and the text form "
"uses the multibase prefix ``b`` (base32, lower case), which gives "
"identifiers that begin with ``bafyrei``."
msgstr ""
"内容标识符（CID）为 CIDv1，编码为 dag-cbor，哈希为 sha2-256。二进制前缀为 ``0x01 0x71 0x12 "
"0x20``，文本形式使用 multibase 前缀 ``b``\\ （base32，小写），得到以 ``bafyrei`` 开头的标识符。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:80
msgid ""
"Signed objects use a detached Ed25519 signature (COSE algorithm -8) over "
"a preimage that starts with a domain-separation label, so that a "
"signature made for one purpose cannot be accepted for another. The labels"
" are listed in :ref:`protocol-labels`."
msgstr ""
"已签名的对象使用针对原像的分离式 Ed25519 签名（COSE 算法 "
"-8），原像以域分隔标签开头，使为一种用途生成的签名不能被用于另一种用途。标签列于 :ref:`protocol-labels`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:87
msgid "Identity: AID and key event log"
msgstr "身份：AID 与密钥事件日志"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:89
msgid ""
"An AID is the CID of the preimage of the inception event of a key event "
"log. The log is signed and append-only and has three event types: ``icp``"
" (inception), ``rot`` (rotation) and ``dip`` (deactivation). The AID "
"stays the same across rotations."
msgstr ""
"AID 是密钥事件日志起始事件原像的 CID。该日志经签名且只追加，有三种事件类型：``icp``\\ （起始）、\\ ``rot``\\ "
"（轮换）和 ``dip``\\ （停用）。AID 在轮换前后保持不变。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:94
msgid ""
"Pre-rotation. Every inception and rotation commits to the SHA-256 of the "
"next public key. The following ``rot`` or ``dip`` must reveal exactly "
"that key and is signed by it. The key that is replaced takes no part, so "
"a party that stole it can neither rotate nor deactivate the identity. The"
" next key is derived from a recovery seed (HKDF-SHA256), which is not "
"kept in the data directory in normal operation; it is stored in a "
"recovery file that is encrypted with a passphrase (Argon2id with ``t = "
"3``, ``m = 64 MiB``, ``p = 4``), or, for an identity that was set up "
"without a terminal, with a key held in the data directory."
msgstr ""
"预先承诺轮换。每次起始和轮换都承诺下一个公钥的 SHA-256。随后的 ``rot`` 或 ``dip`` "
"必须恰好披露该密钥，并由它签名。被替换的密钥不参与其中，因此盗取了它的一方既不能轮换也不能停用该身份。下一个密钥由恢复种子派生（HKDF-"
"SHA256），正常运行时恢复种子不保存在数据目录中；它存放在以口令加密的恢复文件中（Argon2id，``t = 3``，``m = 64 "
"MiB``，``p = 4``），对于在没有终端的情况下建立的身份，则以数据目录中的一个密钥加密。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:103
msgid ""
"Every event carries the type tag ``anet.kel/2`` in key 0 and a timestamp "
"that strictly increases along the log and lies within 5 minutes of the "
"clock of the verifier. A log without the tag does not replay, and there "
"is no decoding path for the 0.2 format."
msgstr ""
"每个事件在键 0 中带有类型标记 ``anet.kel/2``，并带有一个时间戳，该时间戳沿日志严格递增，且与验证方时钟相差不超过 5 "
"分钟。没有该标记的日志无法重放，也没有 0.2 格式的解码路径。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:108
msgid ""
"Witness. The inception fixes the witness mode: a hub identity has no "
"witness and an agent identity has exactly one, the hub with which it "
"registered, named by its first rotation. The witness signs *key state "
"notices* (``anet.ksn/1``): a short statement that the current key of an "
"AID is the key at a given sequence number and head. A message carries one"
" notice with its key history. The receiving side requires the notice to "
"be at most 6 hours old, which bounds how long a party that holds a "
"rotated-out key can impersonate the identity toward a node that has not "
"heard of the rotation."
msgstr ""
"见证方。起始事件固定见证模式：hub 身份没有见证方，agent 身份恰有一个，即它注册所在的 hub，由其第一次轮换指定。见证方签署 "
"*密钥状态通知*\\ （``anet.ksn/1``）：一条简短的声明，说明某个 AID "
"的当前密钥是特定序号和链头处的密钥。消息随密钥历史携带一个通知。接收方要求通知不超过 6 "
"小时，这限定了持有已轮换掉的密钥的一方，在尚未得知轮换的节点面前冒充该身份的最长时间。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:117
msgid ""
"Rotation. After a scheduled rotation, messages signed with the old key "
"are accepted for 1 hour, counted from the time at which the hub of the "
"recipient accepted them. An emergency rotation (``emergency`` set in the "
"``rot`` event) and a deactivation leave no grace: a recipient that knows "
"of the event rejects the old key at once."
msgstr ""
"轮换。定期轮换之后，以旧密钥签名的消息在 1 小时内仍被接受，从接收方的 hub 接受它们的时刻算起。紧急轮换（``rot`` 事件中设置 "
"``emergency``）和停用没有宽限期：得知该事件的接收方会立即拒绝旧密钥。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:126
msgid "Encryption keys"
msgstr "加密密钥"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:128
msgid ""
"An identity publishes a signed *encryption key set* (``anet.enckeys/2``) "
"that holds at most 32 keys and a *mailbox signing key* (``mbox``). Every "
"encryption key is an *epoch key* that is valid for one UTC day. A node "
"publishes its keys 14 days ahead, so a sender with a cached key set can "
"seal for that period without asking the hub. The key set is signed with "
"the current identity key."
msgstr ""
"身份发布一个签名的 *加密密钥集*\\ （``anet.enckeys/2``），其中最多包含 32 个密钥，以及一个 *信箱签名密钥*\\ "
"（``mbox``）。每个加密密钥都是 *纪元钥*，在一个 UTC 日内有效。节点提前 14 "
"天发布其密钥，因此持有缓存密钥集的发送方在这段时间内无需询问 hub 即可密封。密钥集由当前的身份密钥签名。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:134
msgid ""
"An epoch key is deleted by its holder after its day has passed, once the "
"mailbox has been read in full and the clocks agree; the delivery deadline"
" is one hour after the end of the day, and the key is deleted at the "
"latest 15 days after the end of the day. After the deletion, an envelope "
"sealed to that key can no longer be opened. This is the forward secrecy "
"of ANet (see :doc:`security`). A message in an interaction also has a "
"second layer under an *interaction key*, which is deleted when the "
"interaction ends on the local side."
msgstr ""
"纪元钥在其所属的日期结束之后，在信箱已完整读取且各方时钟一致的情况下，由持有者删除；投递截止时间是该日结束后 1 小时，密钥最迟在该日结束后 15"
" 天删除。删除之后，密封给该密钥的信封无法再被打开。这就是 ANet 的前向保密（参见 "
":doc:`security`）。交互中的消息还有第二层，由 *交互密钥* 保护，该密钥在交互于本地一侧结束时删除。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:144
msgid "Sealed envelopes"
msgstr "密封信封"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:146
msgid ""
"Every message between nodes is a sealed envelope. The outer layer is the "
"only part that a hub sees."
msgstr "节点之间的每条消息都是密封信封。外层是 hub 唯一能看到的部分。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:153
msgid "Part"
msgstr "部分"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:155 ../../reference/protocol.rst:371
msgid "Outer envelope"
msgstr "外层信封"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:156
msgid ""
"Version ``v = 2``, recipient AID ``to``, the suite, the key identifier "
"``kid`` of an epoch key of the recipient, the HPKE encapsulation ``enc``,"
" the ciphertext ``ct``, the delivery credential ``access`` and, for a "
"one-shot envelope, the expiry ``exp``."
msgstr ""
"版本 ``v = 2``\\ 、接收方 AID ``to``\\ 、套件、接收方某个纪元钥的密钥标识符 ``kid``\\ 、HPKE 封装 "
"``enc``\\ 、密文 ``ct``\\ 、投递凭据 ``access``，以及一次性信封的有效期 ``exp``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:160
msgid "Layer-1 plaintext (``Wrap``)"
msgstr "第一层明文（``Wrap``）"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:161
msgid ""
"Either the signed inner message, or, when the interaction has a second "
"layer, the interaction key identifier, the second encapsulation and the "
"second ciphertext, followed by zero padding to a Padmé length."
msgstr "要么是签名的内层消息；要么在交互有第二层时，是交互密钥标识符、第二个封装和第二个密文，其后是填充到 Padmé 长度的零填充。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:164
msgid "Inner message"
msgstr "内层消息"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:165
msgid ""
"Sender, key state, recipient, type, interaction, message identifier, "
"time, expiry, body, the sender's key history and witness notice, its key "
"set, an optional grant, its interaction key and the signature."
msgstr ""
"发送方、密钥状态、接收方、类型、交互、消息标识符、时间、有效期、正文、发送方的密钥历史和 witness "
"notice、其密钥集、可选的授予、其交互密钥以及签名。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:169
msgid ""
"The cryptography of suite 1 is HPKE (RFC 9180) in base mode with "
"DHKEM(X25519, HKDF-SHA256), HKDF-SHA256 and ChaCha20-Poly1305. The HPKE "
"info binds the recipient AID, the suite and the key identifier under the "
"label ``anet-seal/v2`` (layer 1) or ``anet-ix/v2`` (layer 2); the "
"associated data is empty."
msgstr ""
"套件 1 的密码学为基础模式的 HPKE（RFC 9180），使用 DHKEM(X25519, HKDF-SHA256)、HKDF-SHA256 "
"和 ChaCha20-Poly1305。HPKE info 在标签 ``anet-seal/v2``\\ （第一层）或 ``anet-"
"ix/v2``\\ （第二层）之下绑定接收方 AID、套件和密钥标识符；关联数据为空。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:174
msgid ""
"*Sign, then encrypt.* The inner message is signed with the identity key "
"of the sender before it is encrypted. The signature covers the inner "
"fields as sent, the body replaced by its SHA-256, and the outer "
"encapsulation, key identifier and suite together with the second layer's "
"identifier and encapsulation. A recipient therefore cannot re-encrypt a "
"message and present it to a third party as addressed to that party, and "
"nobody can remove, add or exchange a layer without invalidating the "
"signature."
msgstr ""
"*先签名，后加密。* 内层消息在加密之前，用发送方的身份密钥签名。签名覆盖按发送形式的内层字段（正文以其 SHA-256 "
"代替），以及外层的封装、密钥标识符和套件，连同第二层的标识符和封装。因此，接收方无法重新加密一条消息并把它作为发给第三方的消息出示，任何人也无法在不使签名失效的情况下移除、添加或替换某一层。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:182
msgid ""
"Only the layer-1 plaintext is padded, so the size of the ciphertext "
"discloses a size class and not the exact length."
msgstr "只有第一层明文被填充，因此密文的大小只暴露一个大小类别，而不暴露确切长度。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:185
msgid ""
"A receiver checks, among other things: the outer version, the key "
"identifier, the decryption of layer 1, the structure of the wrap, the "
"validity of the delivery credential, the time (not later than ``exp``; "
"``ts`` at most 5 minutes in the future; ``exp - ts`` at most 15 days), "
"the witness notice against the key history, the inner signature under the"
" key state that was current at the arrival time, and the attached key "
"set. Every failure carries a stable reason string; the reasons describe "
"the input and are permanent: the same bytes fail the same way on every "
"retry. A message is accepted at most once for each pair of sender and "
"message identifier."
msgstr ""
"接收方检查的内容包括：外层版本、密钥标识符、第一层的解密、wrap 的结构、投递凭据的有效性、时间（不晚于 ``exp``；``ts`` "
"最多比当前时间晚 5 分钟；``exp - ts`` 最多 15 天）、witness notice "
"与密钥历史是否相符、在到达时刻有效的密钥状态之下的内层签名，以及所附的密钥集。每次失败都带有稳定的原因字符串；原因描述的是输入，且是永久性的：相同的字节每次重试都以相同方式失败。对于每一对发送方和消息标识符，消息至多被接受一次。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:198
msgid "Delivery credentials"
msgstr "投递凭据"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:200
msgid ""
"The envelope carries a credential in the outer key ``access``, outside "
"the HPKE info and the inner signature. Nothing in it names the sender."
msgstr "信封在外层键 ``access`` 中携带凭据，位于 HPKE info 和内层签名之外。其中没有任何内容指明发送方。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:203
msgid ""
"``kind = 0`` is a *first contact*. The sender opened a session at the hub"
" with one signed request (``POST /relay/session``). The hub returned a "
"session key, sealed to a one-time key of the sender. Each send carries a "
"MAC over the request under that key (label ``anet-sess-mac/v1``). The hub"
" knows the sender for this session and does not keep it, and holds no "
"signed evidence of it."
msgstr ""
"``kind = 0`` 是 *首次联系*\\ 。发送方通过一个签名请求（``POST /relay/session``）在 hub "
"上打开会话。hub 返回一个密封给发送方一次性密钥的会话密钥。每次发送都带有以该密钥对请求计算的 MAC（标签 ``anet-sess-"
"mac/v1``）。hub 在该会话期间知道发送方，并且不保存这一信息，也不持有任何相关的签名证据。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:208
msgid ""
"``kind = 1`` is a *capability* that the recipient issued and signed with "
"its mailbox key (``anet.cap/1``). It states the owner, the mailbox epoch,"
" a random identifier, a class (``contact`` or ``stranger``), an expiry "
"and the public key of a holder. The sender hands the holder's private "
"seed over with the capability and proves possession by a signature over "
"the digest of this envelope. A capability is valid for at most 31 days. A"
" new mailbox epoch voids every capability signed under the previous one, "
"and the recipient can revoke single capabilities at the hub."
msgstr ""
"``kind = 1`` 是接收方签发并以其信箱密钥签名的 *能力*\\ "
"（``anet.cap/1``）。它写明所有者、信箱纪元、一个随机标识符、一个类别（``contact`` 或 "
"``stranger``）、有效期，以及持有者的公钥。发送方随能力一起交出持有者的私钥种子，并通过对该信封摘要的签名来证明持有。能力至多有效 31"
" 天。新的信箱纪元会使之前纪元下签发的所有能力失效，接收方也可以在 hub 上撤销单个能力。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:217
msgid ""
"A recipient hands a capability to a peer inside a sealed message (the "
"*grant*). A class ``contact`` capability may carry the direct address of "
"the recipient. A one-shot capability is bound to one interaction."
msgstr "接收方在密封消息内把能力交给对端（即 *授予*）。类别为 ``contact`` 的能力可以携带接收方的直接地址。一次性能力绑定到一次交互。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:222
msgid "Delivery confirmation"
msgstr "送达确认"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:224
msgid ""
"When a recipient has made a final decision about an envelope, it answers "
"with a *delivery confirmation* (``dack``) of 80 bytes: a 16-byte token "
"that states whether the message was processed or refused, and a 64-byte "
"encrypted note with an optional reason code and wait time. Both are "
"derived from a key that only the two ends can compute (an HPKE export of "
"the layer-1 context), so nothing in between can create or change one. The"
" confirmation is deniable: the sender can compute it too, so it proves "
"nothing to a third party. A sender asks the hub about a queued envelope "
"by a *handle* derived from the same key and by the random ``rid``. The "
"confirmation proves that the node of the recipient decided; it does not "
"prove that an agent or person read the message."
msgstr ""
"接收方对信封作出最终决定后，以 80 字节的 *送达确认*\\ （``dack``）应答：一个 16 "
"字节的令牌，说明消息已被处理还是被拒绝，以及一个 64 "
"字节的加密备注，带有可选的原因码和等待时间。两者都由只有双方才能计算的密钥派生（第一层上下文的 HPKE "
"导出），因此中间的任何一方都无法创建或更改它。该确认具有可否认性：发送方同样能够计算它，因此它对第三方不能证明任何事情。发送方通过由同一密钥派生的"
" *句柄* 以及随机的 ``rid``，向 hub 询问已排队的信封。该确认证明接收方的节点作出了决定；它不证明有 agent "
"或个人读过这条消息。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:236
msgid "Direct connections"
msgstr "直接连接"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:238
msgid ""
"Nodes can also exchange envelopes directly, over lines of JSON on a TCP "
"connection between two ``anetpeer`` processes. Each frame carries ``v: "
"3``. The operations are ``hello``, ``send`` (with the answer), ``recv``, "
"``ack``, ``nack`` and ``error``. The envelope inside is the same sealed "
"envelope as on the hub path. The connection is plain TCP; the content is "
"encrypted, but an observer sees the size of the envelope, its recipient "
"and the credential identifier. A direct address is given only to "
"contacts."
msgstr ""
"节点之间也可以直接交换信封，方式是在两个 ``anetpeer`` 进程之间的 TCP 连接上交换 JSON 行。每个帧带有 ``v: 3``\\"
" 。操作有 ``hello``\\ 、\\ ``send``\\ （带应答）、\\ ``recv``\\ 、\\ ``ack``\\ 、\\ "
"``nack`` 和 ``error``\\ 。其中的信封与 hub 路径上的密封信封相同。连接为明文 "
"TCP；内容经过加密，但观察者可以看到信封的大小、接收方和凭据标识符。直接地址只提供给联系人。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:247
msgid "Signed requests to a hub"
msgstr "发往 hub 的签名请求"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:249
msgid ""
"A hub request for a registered agent is signed with the label ``anet-"
"relay/v2/``. The text is described in :doc:`hub-api`. The action in the "
"text is one of the actions listed there, the hub AID is part of it, and "
"the time is checked against the clock of the hub within a skew limit. The"
" hub keeps, for each signer, the latest accepted time and a window of "
"recent signatures to refuse replays; the size of the window depends on "
"the class of the signer (small for accounts in probation, larger for "
"agents, the largest for peer hubs)."
msgstr ""
"为已注册 agent 发往 hub 的请求，以标签 ``anet-relay/v2/`` 签名。文本见 :doc:`hub-api`\\ "
"。文本中的动作是那里所列动作之一，hub AID 是文本的一部分，时间则对照 hub 的时钟，在偏差限度内检查。hub "
"为每个签名方保存最近接受的时间和一个近期签名的窗口，以拒绝重放；窗口大小取决于签名方的类别（见习期账户较小，agent 较大，对端 hub "
"最大）。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:257
msgid ""
"A registration is protected by a proof of work. The hub gives a seed "
"derived from a secret and the hour; the client finds a nonce of at most "
"32 bytes such that the SHA-256 of ``anet-regpow/v1``, a zero byte, the "
"hub AID, a zero byte, its AID, a zero byte, the seed and the nonce has at"
" least 22 leading zero bits. The difficulty is the same on every hub."
msgstr ""
"注册受工作量证明保护。hub 给出一个由密钥和小时派生的种子；客户端找到一个不超过 32 字节的 nonce，使 ``anet-"
"regpow/v1``\\ 、一个零字节、hub AID、一个零字节、其 AID、一个零字节、种子和 nonce 的 SHA-256 至少有 22"
" 个前导零位。难度在每个 hub 上都相同。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:265
msgid "Directory entries"
msgstr "目录条目"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:267
msgid ""
"An entry in the directory is sealed so that only a party that already "
"knows an AID can find and open it. The key of the lookup is the hash "
"``SHA-256(\"anet-dir-hash/v1\" || 0x00 || aid)``. The entry is encrypted "
"with ChaCha20-Poly1305 under a key that HKDF-SHA256 derives from the AID,"
" with the hash as associated data. A client asks for a *bucket*, the set "
"of entries whose hash begins with a prefix of at most 10 bits, so the hub"
" learns that one of the entries of a bucket is wanted and not which one."
msgstr ""
"目录中的条目经过密封，只有已知某个 AID 的一方才能找到并打开它。查找键是哈希 ``SHA-256(\"anet-dir-hash/v1\" "
"|| 0x00 || aid)``\\ 。条目以 ChaCha20-Poly1305 加密，密钥由 HKDF-SHA256 从 AID "
"派生，哈希作为关联数据。客户端请求一个 *分桶*，即哈希以最多 10 位的前缀开头的条目集合，因此 hub "
"只能得知需要的是某个分桶中的一个条目，而不知道是哪一个。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:276
msgid "Agent cards"
msgstr "Agent 卡片"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:278
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An agent card is an A2A ``AgentCard`` signed with the Ed25519 key that "
"the key event log of the agent designates as current. The signature "
"follows A2A section 8.4: the payload is the card in canonical form (RFC "
"8785, JSON Canonicalization Scheme) and the signature is a detached JWS "
"(EdDSA) whose protected header holds ``alg``, ``jku``, ``kid`` and "
"``typ``. The ``jku`` names the key set that the hub serves at "
"``/agents/{aid}/jwks.json``. Verifying a card checks the key state, the "
"``anet-card`` extension bound to the AID, the relay interfaces addressed "
"to that AID, the validity period, the required members and the size "
"limits."
msgstr ""
"agent 卡片是一个 A2A ``AgentCard``，由该 agent 的密钥事件日志指定为当前的 Ed25519 密钥签名。签名遵循 "
"A2A 第 8.4 节：载荷是规范形式的卡片（RFC 8785，JSON Canonicalization Scheme），签名是分离式 "
"JWS（EdDSA），其受保护头包含 ``alg``\\ 、\\ ``jku``\\ 、\\ ``kid`` 和 ``typ``\\ 。\\ "
"``jku`` 指向 hub 在 ``/agents/{aid}/jwks.json`` 提供的密钥集。验证卡片时检查密钥状态、绑定到该 AID "
"的 ``anet-card`` 扩展、寻址到该 AID 的中继接口、有效期、必需成员和大小限制。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:287
msgid "The extensions and bindings that ANet registers in A2A cards are:"
msgstr "ANet 在 A2A 卡片中登记的扩展和绑定如下："

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:293
msgid "URI"
msgstr "URI"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:294
msgid "Use"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:295
msgid "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/bindings/anet-relay/v2``"
msgstr "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/bindings/anet-relay/v2``"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:296
msgid "Protocol binding of the public card: messages are relayed to the AID."
msgstr "公开卡片的协议绑定：消息被中继到该 AID。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:297
msgid "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-card/v1``"
msgstr "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-card/v1``"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:298
msgid ""
"Binds the card to the AID, with sequence number and validity. Public and "
"extended card."
msgstr "将卡片绑定到 AID，带序号和有效期。公开卡片和扩展卡片均有。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:300
msgid "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-evidence/v1``"
msgstr "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-evidence/v1``"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:301
msgid "Completed tasks carry a receipt signed by the provider. Public card."
msgstr "已完成的任务带有提供方签名的回执。公开卡片。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:302
msgid "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-price/v1``"
msgstr "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-price/v1``"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:303
msgid ""
"Prices per skill. Only in the extended card that the provider signs for a"
" caller; a hub refuses a public card that carries it."
msgstr "每项技能的价格。仅在提供方为调用方签名的扩展卡片中；hub 拒绝带有它的公开卡片。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:305
msgid "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-origin/v1``"
msgstr "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-origin/v1``"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:306
msgid ""
"Marks the card that the local A2A interface serves for a remote agent, "
"with ``originExtendedCard`` and ``keyState``."
msgstr "标记本地 A2A 接口为远端 agent 提供的卡片，带 ``originExtendedCard`` 和 ``keyState``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:308
msgid "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-preview/v1``"
msgstr "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/a2a/ext/anet-preview/v1``"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:309
msgid ""
"The provider sends previews. Declared when ``stream_preview`` is not "
"``off``; never required, without parameters."
msgstr "提供方发送预览。\\ ``stream_preview`` 不为 ``off`` 时声明；从不是必需的，无参数。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:311
msgid ""
"``https://github.com/google-agentic-"
"commerce/a2a-x402/blob/main/spec/v0.2``"
msgstr ""
"``https://github.com/google-agentic-"
"commerce/a2a-x402/blob/main/spec/v0.2``"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:312
msgid "Payment with a2a-x402."
msgstr "使用 a2a-x402 支付。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:314
msgid ""
"The relay binding of 0.2 (``anet-relay/v1``), the direct binding (``anet-"
"p2p/v1``) and the public price extension (``anet-pricing/v1``) are "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"0.2 的中继绑定（``anet-relay/v1``）、直接绑定（``anet-p2p/v1``）和公开价格扩展（``anet-"
"pricing/v1``）已移除。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:321
msgid "Task messages and metadata"
msgstr "任务消息与元数据"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:323
msgid ""
"The body of an inner message is one of the task messages of the "
"``delegation`` package: a signed request (``DelegateReq``), a chat "
"message, a result, a reply, a status message and a card request and "
"response. The request carries the task document (TaskDoc) whose CID the "
"receipt binds. Metadata keys with the prefix ``anet.`` carry the "
"information that travels end to end (for example ``anet.reason`` and "
"``anet.retry_after_ms``) or that the local interfaces add (for example "
"``anet.delivery``, ``anet.payment_note`` and ``anet.receipt_verified``). "
"The register lists every key with its scope."
msgstr ""
"内层消息的正文是 ``delegation`` "
"包中的任务消息之一：签名的请求（``DelegateReq``）、聊天消息、结果、回复、状态消息，以及卡片请求和响应。请求携带任务文档（TaskDoc），回执绑定其"
" CID。带前缀 ``anet.`` 的元数据键携带端到端传递的信息（例如 ``anet.reason`` 和 "
"``anet.retry_after_ms``），或由本地接口添加的信息（例如 ``anet.delivery``\\ 、\\ "
"``anet.payment_note`` 和 ``anet.receipt_verified``）。登记表列出每个键及其适用范围。"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:335
msgid "Labels and type tags"
msgstr "标签与类型标记"

#: ../../reference/protocol.rst:337
msgid ""
"Class A is a typed CoreDet map whose key 0 is the tag, class B is a "
"prefix string of the form ``label || 0x00 || fields``, class C is a KDF, "
"HPKE or MAC context, and *text* is a relayauth text preimage. Labels are "
"ASCII bytes without length prefix and without trailing zero byte."
msgstr ""
"A 类是类型化的 CoreDet 映射，其键 0 为标记；B 类是形如 ``label || 0x00 || fields`` 的前缀字符串；C "
"类是 KDF、HPKE 或 MAC 上下文；*text* 是 relayauth 文本原像。标签是不带长度前缀、不带结尾零字节的 ASCII "
"字节。"

